      "id": "claim_93b8ecf8664543a185353872854bd036",
      "statement": "The desktop executable becomes a headless MCP stdio server when started with --mcp-stdio: that mode opens no window, reads no project store and performs no client registration, and only forwards tool calls to a running desktop over the local socket.",
