    {
      "id": "claim_eb8ca92bbb6c45d0b4772eef175ab807",
      "statement": "The MCP bridge endpoint is derived from the Electron userData path by hashing it to a short digest and placing a socket under the OS temp directory on Unix or a named pipe on Windows, so different user profiles or checkouts do not share one endpoint.",
